  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ISS - Institute for Security Studies Core Funding 2019-2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Grant provides core support to Institute for Security Studies Core Funding. The ISS improves human security in Africa by focusing on, among others, conflict, development, governance, violent extremism, migration, peacebuilding, crime and security. The ISS is a trusted partner to governments, civil society, the African Union and regional mechanisms. It also partners with international donors, agencies and organisations.</narrative>
  </description>
